  "title": "Add the SQLITE_PREPARE_FROM_DDL flag to sqlite3_prepare_v3(). Use this to prevent fts3/4 tables in non-trusted schemas from calling unsafe SQL functions.",
  "severity": "unknown",
  "keywords": [],
  "product": "sqlite",
